msgid "How to port Python 2 Code to Python 3"
msgstr "Cara Melakukan Porting Kode Python 2 ke Python 3"

msgid ""
"Python 2 reached its official end-of-life at the start of 2020. This means "
"that no new bug reports, fixes, or changes will be made to Python 2 - it's "
"no longer supported: see :pep:`373` and `status of Python versions <https://"
"devguide.python.org/versions>`_."
msgstr ""
"Python 2 mencapai akhir masa dukung resminya pada awal 2020. Ini berarti "
"tidak akan ada lagi laporan bug, perbaikan, atau perubahan baru untuk Python "
"2 - Python 2 tidak lagi didukung: lihat :pep:`373` dan `status versi Python "
"<https://devguide.python.org/versions>`_."

msgid ""
"If you are looking to port an extension module instead of pure Python code, "
"please see :ref:`cporting-howto`."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda ingin mem-porting sebuah modul ekstensi, bukan kode Python murni, "
"silakan lihat :ref:`cporting-howto`."

msgid ""
"The archived python-porting_ mailing list may contain some useful guidance."
msgstr ""
"Milis python-porting_ yang telah diarsipkan mungkin berisi beberapa panduan "
"yang berguna."

msgid ""
"Since Python 3.11 the original porting guide was discontinued. You can find "
"the old guide in the `archive <https://docs.python.org/3.10/howto/"
"pyporting.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Sejak Python 3.11, panduan porting yang asli dihentikan. Anda dapat "
"menemukan panduan lama tersebut di `arsip <https://docs.python.org/3.10/"
"howto/pyporting.html>`_."

msgid "Third-party guides"
msgstr "Panduan pihak ketiga"

